  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You are trained to be more flexible and skilled while you are on fours. You can adjust the grip of your weapons or a shield so that you can benefit from the movement speed adjustment from the Quadrupedal Limbs ancestry feature while wielding them, and do not suffer a penalty to attack rolls for being prone. This benefit ends if you swap or stow your held weapons or shield (but not if you drop them).</span></p>"
